      "title": "True standardized RGO unique proximal point and finite canonical entropy",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06906v1#S4.Ex8",
          "label": "Actual proximal point and standardized posterior; omitted entropy prerequisite",
          "scope": "Source actual standardized RGO canonical finite KL, genuine canonical logratio L1 and AE explicit logdensity/entropy equality; actual unique stationary proximal point to legally join opaque31/32/etc existential witnesses. No pointwise RN differentiability or canonical Fisher/weakSobolev/LSI/T2/W2/bias/main/work/composition credit. Focused3759 passed actual eta2/y3 and dimension0, all3 printed targets standard3 only. Independent proof/blind/source/exactcommit and shared integration admission pending; renderedQA/functionalCopyDownload/postmerge purification remain open."
